From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: strain08 <strain08@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 21:47:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add FreeBSD remote server support

- fs: Fix MaybeUninit field access for FreeBSD kinfo_file (kf_structsize
  must be set via raw pointer before fcntl F_KINFO call)
- fs: Narrow CString import to cfg(macos, linux); remove redundant
  top-level OsStrExt import (already imported locally in each impl)
- gpui: Export queue module and PriorityQueueReceiver/PriorityQueueSender
  for FreeBSD (gpui_linux is compiled on FreeBSD too)
- crashes: Gate crash-handler and minidumper deps to cfg(not(freebsd));
  add no-op FreeBSD stubs for Client, init, crash_server, panic_hook,
  set_gpu_info, set_user_info
- remote_server: Gate crash-handler and minidumper direct deps to
  cfg(not(any(windows, freebsd)))
- remote: Add RemoteOs::FreeBsd variant; map "FreeBSD" uname output in
  parse_platform; add unknown-freebsd target triple for source builds

Release Notes:

- Added FreeBSD remote server support
